 r←Test_UC_024(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;tempDir;cmd;ref;rc;msg;res
⍝ Open a project with ]Cider.OpenProject -verbose: the result must be empty, because the log has been printed already.
⍝ Used to report "Attempt to open the project failed" although the project had been opened.
⍝ Also checks that without -verbose the result still reports success.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕EX'TEMP' ⋄ 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''
 tempDir←∆GetFolderInTempDir⊃⎕SI
 tempDir ⎕NCOPY⍠('Wildcard' 1)('IfExists' 'Replace')⊢##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Tests/Test_Alias/*'
 ref←∆GetRefToCommTools
 ref.AddAutomation'YesOrNo' 'ChangeCurrentDir@' 'n'
 cmd←'OpenProject "',tempDir,'/Project1" -watch=ns -batch -ignoreUserExec'

 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD cmd,' -verbose'
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠≢res
 →T.GoToTidyUp~(⊂'#.TEMP')∊{⍵[;1]}##.Cider.ListOpenProjects 0
 {}0 ⎕SE.Cider.CloseProject'#.TEMP'
 #.⎕EX'TEMP' ⋄ 'TEMP'#.⎕NS''

 (rc msg res)←∆UCMD cmd
 →T.GoToTidyUp 0≠rc
 →T.GoToTidyUp~∨/'Project successfully opened'⍷res

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 ref.Cleanup
 {}0 ⎕SE.Cider.CloseProject'#.TEMP'
 #.⎕EX'TEMP'
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert 0=rc
⍝Done
